From: wangy4645 <happy_scn@163.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 16:21:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] fix(group): admit late peers from channel-less HELLO

Resolve channel-less HELLO against an existing accepted GROUP
session so late-peer admission can reach the existing per-peer
invite path.

Do not mutate membership directly and do not guess a channel when
multiple accepted sessions are ambiguous.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
